From 2d3db6e45a5286cfbbb60df8a4ad5ac9e6925b5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Olin <contact@chrisolin.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:16:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: let a device overlay enable the landscape lock
 screen

lockscreen.enable_landscape stays unreleased, so a user build keeps it
off. An RRO cannot turn an unreleased flag on.
config_enable_lockscreen_landscape defaults false and is OR'd with the
flag. A device overlay sets the bool.

That selects the same behavior the flag does: the split bouncer, the
small lock-screen clock, the split shade, and the 2-by-2 lock-screen
Quick Settings under 600dp.

Change-Id: I1988a3c83aaa9f4c028a5d1321b5552b0519671f
